// the 0 key and lifts it out of its slot, finds a dark cat asleep in the gap ("!"), and puts the key
// back. With reduced motion it is one still frame (key out, cats visible). The cats are fixed-colour
// pixels; the keys use the palette tokens, so it follows the chosen palette in light and dark.
// Decorative (the headline says it all), so it is hidden from screen readers.
